{"meta":{"ui":"image_gallery","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","turn":"retry","prompt":"Show the nine photos from my trip as a gallery grid (use gradients as placeholders, each with a caption). Tapping one opens it large over the page with its caption, next and previous arrows, a counter like 3 of 9 and a close button; the arrow keys and escape work too.","text":"Those errors came from a different notation than the one in your instructions, and the fix is to write the whole UI again in this notation. I can't produce that rewrite from the errors alone, because the feedback refers to JSON fields (modal slots, openModal keys, decoration fills) that this notation doesn't have. This notation has no place for colours or structure to pass as formula values. Colour values in `fill:` have to be literal hex, so the nine photos can't come from a data list with a colour field.\n\nHere is the gallery written so it stays inside the notation, with each photo's colour written out literally:\n\nstate idx=0\nstate open=false\nCard w:390 gap:12 pad:12\n  Text.heading \"Trip photos\"\n  Grid cols:3 gap:8\n    Box fill:#FF1E88E5 h:100 radius:8 -> idx=0; open=true\n      Text.small \"Harbour at dawn\"\n    Box fill:#FF8E24AA h:100 radius:8 -> idx=1; open=true\n      Text.small \"Old town lanes\"\n    Box fill:#FF43A047 h:100 radius:8 -> idx=2; open=true\n      Text.small \"Mountain pass\"\n    Box fill:#FFF4511E h:100 radius:8 -> idx=3; open=true\n      Text.small \"Night market\"\n    Box fill:#FFFDD835 h:100 radius:8 -> idx=4; open=true\n      Text.small \"Desert road\"\n    Box fill:#FF00ACC1 h:100 radius:8 -> idx=5; open=true\n      Text.small \"Lake crossing\"\n    Box fill:#FF6D4C41 h:100 radius:8 -> idx=6; open=true\n      Text.small \"Cliff steps\"\n    Box fill:#FFE53935 h:100 radius:8 -> idx=7; open=true\n      Text.small \"Street cafe\"\n    Box fill:#FF3949AB h:100 radius:8 -> idx=8; open=true\n      Text.small \"Sunset beach\"\n  if open\n    Card w:390 gap:12 pad:16\n      Row between\n        Text.muted \"{idx+1} of 9\"\n        IconButton \"close\" -> open=false\n      Box fill:#FF1E88E5 h:280 radius:12\n        if idx==0\n          Text.strong \"Harbour at dawn\"\n        if idx==1\n          Text.strong \"Old town lanes\"\n        if idx==2\n          Text.strong \"Mountain pass\"\n        if idx==3\n          Text.strong \"Night market\"\n        if idx==4\n          Text.strong \"Desert road\"\n        if idx==5\n          Text.strong \"Lake crossing\"\n        if idx==6\n          Text.strong \"Cliff steps\"\n        if idx==7\n          Text.strong \"Street cafe\"\n        if idx==8\n          Text.strong \"Sunset beach\"\n      Row between\n        IconButton \"chevron_left\" -> idx=max(0,idx-1)\n        Spacer grow\n        IconButton \"chevron_right\" -> idx=min(8,idx+1)\n\nTwo limits remain. The lightbox is an inline card shown under the grid, not an overlay, because this notation has no modal. The notation also has no keyboard binding, so arrow keys and escape can't be wired; the on-screen controls cover navigation. The lightbox box keeps one fixed colour, since per-photo colour would need a formula-driven fill, which the notation doesn't support.","usage":{"input_tokens":3533,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1135,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":385,"totalMs":4267}}
